[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0010","text":"————嗯啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0020","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0030","text":"————『新干线正以时速200公里行驶』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0040","text":"……！\n嗯、嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0050","text":"『此时以50公里的投球速度\n　进行传接球的话』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0060","text":"诶～……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0070","text":"『从外部来看，这场传接球的\n　投球速度看起来就是时速250公里』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0080","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0090","text":"应、应该是……这样……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12000100_01_0100","text":"嗯啊——……"}]
